[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13261.19, "timestamp": "03:41:01", "text": "他们一直想做的那些事"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13263.119, "timestamp": "03:41:03", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "they also hv to sign a crazy nda"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13263.63, "timestamp": "03:41:03", "text": "被允许。以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13267.429, "timestamp": "03:41:07", "text": "如果我在这两个时间段内是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13270.87, "timestamp": "03:41:10", "text": "正确的。这取决于具体机构。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13273.67, "timestamp": "03:41:13", "text": "是的。我们需要疯狂的印度。是的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13275.316, "timestamp": "03:41:15", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ohh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13276.67, "timestamp": "03:41:16", "text": "疯狂的印度并非必需品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13279.67, "timestamp": "03:41:19", "text": "是的。比如，如果你花了100，他们就会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13281.83, "timestamp": "03:41:21", "text": "当然必须在50之前让步，因为他们会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13289.99, "timestamp": "03:41:29", "text": "他们总是会这么做，这显而易见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13292.83, "timestamp": "03:41:32", "text": "除非你疯了，否则你肯定做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13295.83, "timestamp": "03:41:35", "text": "专业的。别学我。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13298.229, "timestamp": "03:41:38", "text": "我觉得我……我打破了好多条规则"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13301.71, "timestamp": "03:41:41", "text": "现在公司规则就是这样。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13306.03, "timestamp": "03:41:46", "text": "呃，只是做我自己，而且我当时并不知道自己在做什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13308.389, "timestamp": "03:41:48", "text": "不知不觉。但当我仔细想想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13310.389, "timestamp": "03:41:50", "text": "从逻辑上讲，我会想：“是啊，我不应该……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13314.229, "timestamp": "03:41:54", "text": "已经做到了。那就是ilo，那就是，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13317.349, "timestamp": "03:41:57", "text": "就像我这边不负责任一样，我是"}]